+## 5. Rule-by-rule static soundness review
+
+### Exhaustive inventory
+
+[`K-RULE-INVENTORY.md`](/audit-output/evidence/K-RULE-INVENTORY.md) inventories
+every local `configuration`, `syntax`, `context`, `rule`, and `claim` in all 24
